<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Acacia lifts resource to 6 mln oz gold.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Acacia lifts resource to 6 mln oz gold.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acacia Resources Ltd said on Tuesday its equity share of contained gold in resources had risen 15 percent to about 6.0 million ounces.</p>
</text>
